  "details": "Description\n\nSometimes I'll lag really bad and once I stop, my sound stops working along with my mic. The only things that fix it is turning off and back on the headset or going back into the oculus menu and selecting VRChat.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nTo fix it for me, turn the headset off and back on again or going into the oculus menu and clicking on VRC.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: Quest (platform: Android - Quest, store: Oculus, headset: Oculus Quest 2)\n\nrawPlatform: Android\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.1p3-1939-4803d92ede-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-17_19-34-45.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_ae8f19fd-1704-4156-8b3a-26605b020371/1/file)",
